{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50310","headline":"晚秋登城之作 二 · 佚名","name":"晚秋登城之作 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东山日色片光残，西岭云各暝草寒。\n谷口穹庐遥逦迤，磎边牛马暮盘跚。\n目前愁见川至窄，望处心迷兴不宽。\n乡国未知何所在，路逢相识问看看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}